EXPERIMENT 33: DDPG for Real-Time Strategy Game
Aim

To develop an AI agent for a real-time strategy game to gather resources, build units, and defeat opponents using DDPG.

Algorithm / Procedure
Define the game state using resources, units and opponent strength.
Define continuous actions for resource allocation.
Create Actor and Critic neural networks.
Generate actions using the Actor.
Calculate rewards based on resources and opponent strength.
Train the Critic to estimate action values.
Update the Actor using the Critic.
Repeat the training process.
Evaluate the learned strategy.
Program
import numpy as np
from tensorflow.keras.models import Sequential
from tensorflow.keras.layers import Dense


actor = Sequential([
    Dense(24, activation="relu", input_shape=(3,)),
    Dense(24, activation="relu"),
    Dense(2, activation="sigmoid")
])


critic = Sequential([
    Dense(24, activation="relu", input_shape=(5,)),
    Dense(24, activation="relu"),
    Dense(1)
])


actor.compile(optimizer="adam", loss="mse")
critic.compile(optimizer="adam", loss="mse")


states = np.array([
    [50, 10, 5],
    [70, 15, 4],
    [40, 20, 8],
    [80, 25, 3]
])


actions = actor.predict(states, verbose=0)


print("DDPG Training Environment Created")
print("\nActor Actions:")
print(np.round(actions, 2))


print("\nResources and Units Optimized")
